{'symbol': 'NTRS', 'date': '2022-04-04 15:00:00', 'title': 'NORTHERN TRUST ASSET MANAGEMENT NAMES CO-HEAD OF FIXED INCOME', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORTHERN TRUST ASSET MANAGEMENT (NTAM) ANNOUNCED THAT THOMAS SWANEY HAS JOINED THE FIRM TODAY AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CO-HEAD OF FIXED INCOME FOR THE GLOBAL FINANCIAL INSTITUTION WITH $1.3 TRILLION IN ASSETS UNDER MANAGEMENT, INCLUDING $551 BILLION IN FIXED INCOME, AS OF DECEMBER 31, 2021. SWANEY WILL EQUALLY SHARE OVERALL OVERSIGHT RESPONSIBILITY, INCLUDING STRATEGY, PROCESS AND APPROACH FOR THE FIRM'S FIXED INCOME STRATEGIES, WITH FELLOW EVP AND FIXED INCOME"}